  "releaseNotes": "**DI024 compound cancellation loops** — hosted-service scope-per-iteration analysis now recognises parenthesised `&&` and `||` compositions of long-running loop conditions and applies De Morgan semantics to negated cancellation-token conditions. Hoisted scopes and scoped services are reported when the compound condition can run for the host lifetime, while bounded conjunctions and unproven conditions remain silent.",
